SUMMARY: THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating (July 2nd) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 (Free Online Event)\n\nJoin us for an open and thought-provoking conversat
 ion exploring the challenges of modern dating in today's fast-changing wor
 ld. Together we'll discuss topics such as online dating\, communication\, 
 expectations\, loneliness\, emotional health\, building meaningful relatio
 nships\, and the qualities that help create lasting connections\, all with
 in a respectful\, welcoming environment that encourages honest conversatio
 n\, personal growth\, and practical insights.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease 
 join us between 8:00 pm and 8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins 
 right away :)\n\n***\n\nCamera's On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\
 n\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick ar
 ound after the event for Steve Flemming Presents: Songs and Stories that S
 tir the Soul**\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/315427766/
