SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 2nd) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with H
 eart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, loss and the search for what matter
 s in life :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://you
 tu.be/vei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtfu
 l songwriting\n* Folk music and country storytelling\n* Life reflection an
 d meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help us understand ourselves a little be
 tter\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs abo
 ut ordinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the s
 earch for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting
  at 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve
  Flemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@St
 eveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with 
 Heart (Thursday\, July 2nd)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs exp
 lore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\
 , and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, and sing
 er-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on themes of love\, loss\, hop
 e\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal growth\, spirituali
 ty\, and the search for meaning. His songs often feature memorable charact
 ers\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\, and a deep curiosity ab
 out life and human nature. Whether telling a story\, sharing a life lesson
 \, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the state of the wor
 ld\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, compassion\, and a 
 greater appreciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Songs containing:**
 \n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine craftsmanship\n
 \n**Songs that ask the questions**\n\n* What makes a good life?\n* What ma
 kes a good person?\n* What causes us to lose ourselves?\n* What helps us f
 ind ourselves again?\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a pr
 olific folk-country singer-songwriter whose songs explore ordinary people\
 , gratitude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search
  for meaning.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs 
 explore freedom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom
  hidden in ordinary life\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pa
 y What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay
  pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is
  greatly appreciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings amo
 ng music lovers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/
 495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-
