SUMMARY:The Friday Night Ultimate Pub Crawl! (Live Band\, DJ and Dancing) 
 (Ladies Night!)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **Kindly Read Carefully:**\n\nWanna make some new friends in the best part
  of town?\n\nLet's start our weekend off right with a fun night out\, with
  good times\, conversations and a couple cool venues with Live Music\, DJ 
 and Dancing. (Possibly a 3rd venue)\n\nFirst we will meet at ***(La Carnit
 a - (main floor to find us)*** to get our evening going. (Conveniently loc
 ated at Yonge & Eglinton\; 3-4 minute walk east on Eglinton.\n\nThe next v
